# OPTIONAL Tier 1 extra (NOT RUN; un-benchmarked). ORCA 6.1.1 STEOM-CCSD singlets and triplets for boroxine (11).
# A different method from ADC(2)/SCS-CC2 (implicit triples); exploratory, NOT part of the frozen falsifier.
# Run two jobs: this one (DoTriplet false -> singlets) and a copy with DoTriplet true (triplets).
! STEOM-CCSD def2-TZVP def2-TZVP/C TightSCF FrozenCore
%maxcore 3000
%pal nprocs 8 end
%mdci
  NRoots 4
  DoTriplet false
  DoDbFilter true
end
* xyzfile 0 1 ../../xyz/11.xyz
